WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.774
Your laptop's on the TV.

00:00:02.147 --> 00:00:02.940
Or the projector.

00:00:03.325 --> 00:00:04.202
Or across the room,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:05.404
running the show.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:06.738
You're over here.

00:00:07.122 --> 00:00:07.699
That's fine.

00:00:08.819 --> 00:00:10.033
This is Edgepad five.

00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:12.665
A free, open-source Android app that turns

00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:14.012
your phone into the trackpad,

00:00:14.216 --> 00:00:17.004
keyboard, gamepad and remote for your laptop.

00:00:17.401 --> 00:00:19.432
Windows, Mac or Linux.

00:00:20.677 --> 00:00:22.552
The middle is a multi-touch trackpad.

00:00:22.948 --> 00:00:24.030
The corners are dials.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.712
Slide for volume.

00:00:26.096 --> 00:00:29.173
Brightness. Zoom. Scrub through a video.

00:00:29.546 --> 00:00:30.579
Split the corners,

00:00:30.772 --> 00:00:32.238
and four dials become eight.

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.797
Change the volume on the laptop,

00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:36.371
and the dial moves with it.

00:00:37.343 --> 00:00:39.651
Tap Controls, and the phone becomes whatever

00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:40.444
you need next.

00:00:41.164 --> 00:00:42.138
A full keyboard,

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:43.508
in six sizes,

00:00:43.664 --> 00:00:44.866
from a full board with a number

00:00:44.866 --> 00:00:47.006
pad down to a compact sixty percent.

00:00:47.726 --> 00:00:50.250
A gamepad with two sticks and analog

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.497
triggers. On Windows and Linux,

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:55.177
your laptop sees a real Xbox controller,

00:00:55.574 --> 00:00:56.728
so your games just work.

00:00:59.448 --> 00:01:01.491
Drag every control where your thumbs want

00:01:01.491 --> 00:01:03.150
it, or start from a racing,

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.025
platformer or shooter layout.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:06.857
Giving a talk?

00:01:07.242 --> 00:01:09.417
Presenter steps through your slides,

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:12.025
and a laser dot follows your thumb.

00:01:12.745 --> 00:01:13.623
Capture a region,

00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:15.870
the full screen or a recording,

00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:17.541
and send it straight to your phone.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:19.839
Copy on one,

00:01:20.092 --> 00:01:20.909
paste on the other.

00:01:21.294 --> 00:01:23.132
Clipboard sync works both ways,

00:01:23.373 --> 00:01:24.395
and keeps a history.

00:01:25.115 --> 00:01:26.280
Send files either way,

00:01:26.809 --> 00:01:28.264
up to two gigabytes each.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:29.165
Pick a few,

00:01:29.441 --> 00:01:30.006
watch them go,

00:01:30.018 --> 00:01:30.848
pause any time.

00:01:31.568 --> 00:01:32.794
Macros open apps,

00:01:32.974 --> 00:01:34.344
folders and websites.

00:01:34.741 --> 00:01:35.955
Draw a shape on the trackpad,

00:01:36.231 --> 00:01:37.085
and one runs.

00:01:38.454 --> 00:01:40.377
Writing code? Turn on developer mode.

00:01:40.762 --> 00:01:42.685
Your Claude Code and Codex limits,

00:01:42.757 --> 00:01:44.897
your spend and every open session,

00:01:45.341 --> 00:01:45.978
right on your phone.

00:01:46.698 --> 00:01:48.742
Pull requests and issues from GitHub,

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.172
GitLab and more.

00:01:50.557 --> 00:01:51.975
Tap one, and it opens on the

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:52.600
laptop.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.849
Air mouse: tilt to aim,

00:01:56.306 --> 00:01:57.351
hold a button to drag.

00:01:58.071 --> 00:01:59.357
Falling asleep to a film?

00:01:59.706 --> 00:02:02.146
Edgepad puts the laptop to sleep when

00:02:02.146 --> 00:02:02.687
it ends.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.633
No account. No server.

00:02:06.017 --> 00:02:07.580
Your phone talks straight to your laptop,

00:02:07.964 --> 00:02:10.897
over Bluetooth, Wi-Fi or USB.

00:02:11.617 --> 00:02:13.624
Windows is tested on real hardware.

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:15.163
Mac and Linux are newer,

00:02:15.571 --> 00:02:17.001
so tell us on GitHub when something's

00:02:17.014 --> 00:02:17.398
off.

00:02:18.454 --> 00:02:19.957
Coming in Edgepad six:

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.505
screen mirroring, and remote access.

00:02:26.788 --> 00:02:29.011
Edgepad. Free and open source,

00:02:29.228 --> 00:02:29.768
on GitHub.

00:02:30.488 --> 00:02:32.496
Your laptop, from anywhere in the room.
